  "locked": true,
  "problems": [],
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": "B1",
      "duration": 13.0,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B1.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "6ba2dc6cc668175d3453f555d9f41a6f84591706d90e47af7065afbba4f4b13a",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "What happens when weight is placed on a bridge?",
          "start": 0.4,
          "end": 3.55,
          "rel_start": 0.0,
          "rel_end": 3.15
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Traffic, people and the bridge's own weight all press down on its deck.",
          "start": 3.95,
          "end": 8.4,
          "rel_start": 3.55,
          "rel_end": 8.0
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "To stay standing, the bridge has to carry that load down into the ground.",
          "start": 8.8,
          "end": 13.4,
          "rel_start": 8.4,
          "rel_end": 13.0
        }
      ],
      "shot": "SC_001",
      "shots": [
        "SC_001"
      ],
      "start_seconds": 0.4
    },
    {
      "id": "B2",
      "duration": 18.75,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B2.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "c095391699bd58e17c3c1c188e4798a107211e47b910f709671fdb64ead69693",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "The load follows a path down through the structure.",
          "start": 14.608333,
          "end": 17.858333,
          "rel_start": 0.0,
          "rel_end": 3.25
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "The deck is carried by the superstructure, the part of the bridge that spans the gap.",
          "start": 18.258333,
          "end": 23.408333,
          "rel_start": 3.65,
          "rel_end": 8.8
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "That rests on the substructure: abutments at the ends, and sometimes piers in between.",
          "start": 23.808333,
          "end": 29.408333,
          "rel_start": 9.2,
          "rel_end": 14.8
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "The abutments pass the load on to the foundations.",
          "start": 29.808333,
          "end": 33.358333,
          "rel_start": 15.2,
          "rel_end": 18.75
        }
      ],
      "shot": "SC_002",
      "shots": [
        "SC_002"
      ],
      "start_seconds": 14.608333
    },
    {
      "id": "B3",
      "duration": 17.1,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B3.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "24c25d2b9713d3ffa396ca1af2c7d6e2aafd7e7a54cab591fdd0efd5acf45bd8",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Now take a beam bridge.",
          "start": 34.566667,
          "end": 36.791667,
          "rel_start": 0.0,
          "rel_end": 2.225
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Its deck rests on long beams that span from one support to the next.",
          "start": 37.191667,
          "end": 41.741667,
          "rel_start": 2.625,
          "rel_end": 7.175
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "Each beam carries the load by resisting bending.",
          "start": 42.141667,
          "end": 45.741667,
          "rel_start": 7.575,
          "rel_end": 11.175
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "A cap beam spreads the load onto the posts, and the posts carry it down in compression.",
          "start": 46.141667,
          "end": 51.666667,
          "rel_start": 11.575,
          "rel_end": 17.1
        }
      ],
      "shot": "SC_003",
      "shots": [
        "SC_003"
      ],
      "start_seconds": 34.566667
    },
    {
      "id": "B4",
      "duration": 8.3,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B4.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "0e08d205e846c86213d5a96f45e5e9677f359c98494902a8dd17f0ad6112ead5",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "A masonry arch works differently.",
          "start": 52.9,
          "end": 55.6,
          "rel_start": 0.0,
          "rel_end": 2.7
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "It is built from wedge-shaped stones called voussoirs, with a keystone at the crown.",
          "start": 56.0,
          "end": 61.2,
          "rel_start": 3.1,
          "rel_end": 8.3
        }
      ],
      "shot": "SC_004",
      "shots": [
        "SC_004",
        "SC_005"
      ],
      "start_seconds": 52.9
    },
    {
      "id": "B5",
      "duration": 14.4,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B5.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "01ff2816debac432e0bc196b5b6f5ab156f9f6135d7dda83135d072a15f514ad",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "The curve turns the downward load into thrust along the arch, pressing the stones together.",
          "start": 62.4,
          "end": 67.85,
          "rel_start": 0.0,
          "rel_end": 5.45
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "So the arch works mainly in compression.",
          "start": 68.25,
          "end": 71.2,
          "rel_start": 5.85,
          "rel_end": 8.8
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "At each end it pushes outward and down on its supports, and the supports push back.",
          "start": 71.6,
          "end": 76.8,
          "rel_start": 9.2,
          "rel_end": 14.4
        }
      ],
      "shot": "SC_006",
      "shots": [
        "SC_006"
      ],
      "start_seconds": 62.4
    },
    {
      "id": "B6",
      "duration": 24.325,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B6.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "e8ac810563d9d0226c589d0486b524f6c65213bae4221b7adf9839b81d12d671",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "The truss we started with takes another approach: straight members joined into triangles.",
          "start": 78.025,
          "end": 83.625,
          "rel_start": 0.0,
          "rel_end": 5.6
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Each member is mainly pulled or pushed along its length, in tension or in compression.",
          "start": 84.025,
          "end": 89.6,
          "rel_start": 6.0,
          "rel_end": 11.575
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "Each span here is a simple span, so under a downward load its top chord is squeezed and its bottom chord is stretched.",
          "start": 90.0,
          "end": 97.15,
          "rel_start": 11.975,
          "rel_end": 19.125
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "Inside, some web members are in compression and others are in tension.",
          "start": 97.55,
          "end": 102.35,
          "rel_start": 19.525,
          "rel_end": 24.325
        }
      ],
      "shot": "SC_007",
      "shots": [
        "SC_007"
      ],
      "start_seconds": 78.025
    },
    {
      "id": "B7",
      "duration": 17.025,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B7.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "e46550a73854ddad600517dcb9abef031b51352e63dac04ab795b4c49543fcc0",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Let's compare them one at a time.",
          "start": 103.566667,
          "end": 106.241667,
          "rel_start": 0.0,
          "rel_end": 2.675
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "The beam bridge carries its load by bending.",
          "start": 106.641667,
          "end": 109.916667,
          "rel_start": 3.075,
          "rel_end": 6.35
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "The arch carries it mainly in compression, pushing against its supports.",
          "start": 110.316667,
          "end": 115.016667,
          "rel_start": 6.75,
          "rel_end": 11.45
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "In the truss, the load is shared between members in tension and in compression.",
          "start": 115.416667,
          "end": 120.591667,
          "rel_start": 11.85,
          "rel_end": 17.025
        }
      ],
      "shot": "SC_008",
      "shots": [
        "SC_008",
        "SC_009",
        "SC_010"
      ],
      "start_seconds": 103.566667
    },
    {
      "id": "B8",
      "duration": 13.675,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B8.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "226ed651500093e3b64b80c956dfb4eb82af6be129453f16e1caf7f8f87fb301",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Three arrangements of parts, one job: carrying the load across the gap and down into the ground.",
          "start": 121.816667,
          "end": 127.766667,
          "rel_start": 0.0,
          "rel_end": 5.95
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "These models are illustrations, not engineering designs, and the arrows show ideas, not calculated forces.",
          "start": 128.166667,
          "end": 135.491667,
          "rel_start": 6.35,
          "rel_end": 13.675
        }
      ],
      "shot": "SC_011",
      "shots": [
        "SC_011"
      ],
      "start_seconds": 121.816667
    }
  ],
